    "title": "Work starts for Wilmington kayak launch - NewsBreak",
    "text": "1 days ago Earth moving has begun for a new kayak launch and parking lot on the North Island Park. A crew from Austin Tyler Company began moving dirt for the enhanced parking lot that will be near the north tip of the park. The project has been two years in the making after the city originally rejected a possible grant in the summer of 2021 fearing liability if someone drowned. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 1",
